# Explicit binary markers -- don't rely on git's heuristic auto-detect
# for files that must survive byte-for-byte on every clone/checkout
# (a corrupted tiles/huambo.mbtiles would silently blank the basemap
# with no obvious error). "text: unspecified" showed these were
# previously undeclared, protected only by heuristic detection.
*.mbtiles binary
*.png binary
*.pdf binary
